@startuml payment-settlement
' AI-generated draft. Not reviewed. Not rendered: PlantUML was unavailable when authored.
title Payment settlement (proposal)\nFR-030, FR-031, FR-032, FR-033, FR-027. Draft pending human review

actor "Payer\n(signed-in user)" as Payer
participant "PaymentFormPanel" as Panel
participant "PaymentController" as Ctrl
participant "PaymentService" as Svc
participant "AccessPolicy" as Access
participant "TransactionRunner" as Tx
participant "LedgerReader" as Reader
participant "LedgerQueryRepository" as Ledger
participant "BalanceCalculator" as Calc
participant "Payment" as Pay
participant "PaymentRepository" as Repo

Payer -> Panel : amount, date, group, recipient, optional note
Panel -> Ctrl : submit raw values
Ctrl -> Svc : recordPayment(session, draft without acknowledgedOwed)

Svc -> Svc : parse and validate fields (FR-030)
alt invalid: amount not above 0, over 2 decimals, future date, no group, self-payment
  Svc --> Ctrl : ValidationException
  Ctrl --> Panel : field errors, input kept
else valid
  Svc -> Tx : inTransaction
  activate Tx
  Tx -> Access : requireActiveMember for payer and recipient (FR-030)
  Tx -> Reader : owedBy(payer, recipient, group)
  Reader -> Ledger : entriesForPair(group, payer, recipient)
  note right of Ledger : Approved expense shares and payments only.\nOnly the named group (FR-027).
  Reader -> Calc : calculate(entries)
  Calc --> Reader : BalanceSheet
  Reader --> Tx : owedNow = max(0, payer's net debt)

  alt amount above owedNow and acknowledgedOwed absent or different (FR-032, AD-13)
    Tx --> Svc : nothing written
    Svc --> Ctrl : OverpaymentWarning(owedNow, attempted)
    Ctrl --> Panel : confirmation dialog
    alt user confirms
      Panel -> Ctrl : confirm
      Ctrl -> Svc : recordPayment(session, draft with acknowledgedOwed = owedNow)
      note right of Svc : Runs this flow again. A changed owed amount\nproduces a fresh warning.
    else user cancels
      Panel --> Payer : form retained, no payment recorded
    end
  else amount within owedNow, or acknowledged amount matches
    Tx -> Pay : create(...)
    note right of Pay : overpaymentConfirmed recorded for audit.\nImmutable (NFR-006).
    Tx -> Repo : insert(payment)
    note right of Repo : FR-031: applies at commit.\nNo recipient confirmation.\nBalance is derived, so no balance row changes.
    Svc --> Ctrl : Recorded(paymentView)
    Ctrl --> Panel : confirmation, refresh balances
  end
  deactivate Tx
end

== History. FR-033 ==

Payer -> Ctrl : open history
Ctrl -> Svc : paymentHistory(session, group)
Svc -> Repo : listForUser(user, group)
note right of Repo : Same records visible to payer and recipient
Svc --> Ctrl : payment views

note over Svc, Repo
  Worked example, Scenario 6.2: sam owes alex 30.00, sam pays 40.00.
  Warning shown, then confirmed. Entries: sam owes alex 30.00; alex owes sam 40.00.
  Net: alex owes sam 10.00.
end note

@enduml
